config BR2_PACKAGE_AXERA_NPU
	bool "axera-npu"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  The NPU driver of Axera AX620E chips (ax620e-npu), with the
	  vendor's /dev/npu interface, for the axera_npu Elixir library.
	  The device tree needs the NPU's node and its memory pool.

	  https://github.com/cocoa-xu/axera_npu

comment "axera-npu needs a Linux kernel to be built"
	depends on !BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
